<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 583.47, up 1.50.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.03.</p>
<p>Breadth was almost even. Winners beat losers 260 to 254.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 28,388,795 compared with 22,992,430 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
